ST111  Unknown discriminator value
checks response_schema_conformance

Discriminator value that matches no schema in the `discriminator` mapping.

One unknown value is reported per response, so rerunning after a fix can show
the next one.

`--exclude-checks response_schema_conformance` turns it off, along with ST109,
ST110, ST114, ST115.
